<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Oppenheimer cuts Illinova.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Oppenheimer cuts Illinova.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer said Tuesday it had cut its rating on Illinova Corp to market perform from outperform based on the stock's price.</p>
<p>-- Oppenheimer sees the stock worth $0.50-$0.75 more than its current trading price of $28.</p>
<p>-- Oppenheimer said Illinova's fundamentals are fine. The company has excellent management, above-average dividends and earnings growth.</p>
</text>
